     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRFamilyMemberHistoryLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRFamilyMemberHistoryLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRFamilyMemberHistoryLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-family-member-history</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-antecedents-familiaux</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.header.status</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.statusCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.relatedPerson</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.subject.relatedSubject</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.condition</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.component:frAntecedentFamilialObserve</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.condition.code</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.component:frAntecedentFamilialObserve.code</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.condition.outcome</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.component:frAntecedentFamilialObserve.value</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.condition.contributedToDeath</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.component:frAntecedentFamilialObserve.value</td><td>La contribution au décès est rapprochée de la valeur d'observation faute d'attribut CDA dédié explicite.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.condition.onset[x]</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.component:frAntecedentFamilialObserve.effectiveTime</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.condition.bodySite</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.component:frAntecedentFamilialObserve.targetSiteCode</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory.note</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#relatedto\" title=\"relatedto\">is related to</a></td><td>FRCDAAntecedentsFamiliaux.text</td><td>Le commentaire métier est porté dans la narration CDA.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-lm-family-member-history</code> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/document/core/StructureDefinition/fr-family-member-history-document</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMFamilyMemberHistory</td><td><a href=\"h